Backport of llvm/llvm-project#185130, "[ObjC] Emit number, array, and dictionary literals as constants" (merged 2026-03-25), to
swiftlang/llvm-project swift-6.4.0-RELEASE (docs/adr/0170-xcodes-clang-abi-and-a-patched-clang.md, B-170).
Adapted: the options go in clang/include/clang/Driver/Options.td (upstream has since moved the file to
clang/include/clang/Options/), before `fno_common`.

Adapted: CodeGenModule::DefaultPtrTy is UnqualPtrTy before llvm-project's rename.
